rm.{u_1} t₁ t₂ → Eq.{u_1 + 1} (List.diff.{u_1} l t₁) (List.diff.{u_1} l t₂)","unsafe":false,"value":1358,"source":{"code":"theorem Perm.diff_left [BEq α] [LawfulBEq α] (l : List α) (h : t₁ ~ t₂) :\n    l.diff t₁ = l.diff t₂ := by\n  induction h generalizing l with try simp [List.diff]\n  | cons x _ ih => apply ite_congr rfl <;> (intro; apply ih)\n  | swap x y =>\n    if h : x = y then\n      simp [h]\n    else\n      simp [mem_erase_of_ne h, mem_erase_of_ne (Ne.symm h), erase_comm x y]\n      split <;> simp\n  | trans => simp only [*]","start":189,"end":199},"axioms":["Classical.choice","Quot.sound","propext"]}